Hello All,

Following are part numbers and list prices for PVC Collets for IPS-OD 3G fi=
ttings.  =93Collet=94 is Philmac terminology for =93grip ring=94.  This col=
let allows a Philmac 3G IPS-OD joint to grip an IPS PVC pipe.

Part #
Description
List Price
75-6893
3/4" IPS PVC Collet
$2.88
75-6894
1" IPS PVC Collet
$3.36
75-6895
1 1/4" IPS PVC Collet
$5.29
75-6896
1 1/2" IPS PVC Collet
$8.01
75-6898
2" IPS PVC Collet
$9.93

Note this is not a kit containing the rest of a compression =93end=94 (nut =
and seal).  It is just the collet alone.

Customer would buy a 3G IPS-OD Fitting and PVC Collets separately.  He woul=
d then replace the standard collet with the PVC collet by removing the nut,=
 removing the standard collet, installing the PVC collet, and replacing the=
 nut.  He would dispose of the standard collet.

Harco will not be assembling PVC collets into fittings for customers.

The PVC Collet looks the same as the standard collet except it has a single=
 stainless steel split ring that is fitted into the collet.  You have to lo=
ok hard to see that there is a difference.  This SS ring grips PVC pipe whe=
n the nut tightens the assembly.  The standard collet will not reliably gri=
p PVC pipe.

If a customer wants a fitting to transition from PVC to PE in sizes 2=94 an=
d smaller this would be an option.


Literature, flyers etc will come later.

John

